        "content": "<div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\">\n  <h2>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f On-Demand OWASP Security Scan</h2>\n  <p>Run an authenticated ASTF scan and open the generated HTML report from CentralWatch.</p>\n  <br/>\n  <a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8080/#security-scan\" target=\"_top\" style=\"padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #3274D9; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold;\">Open Scan Control</a>\n  <br/><br/>\n  <p><i>The unified dashboard handles operator authentication and submits the required POST request.</i></p>\n</div>",
